cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use claude-bootstrap in a published work or production setup, please cite it as below."
title: "claude-bootstrap — opinionated Claude Code project scaffolder"
abstract: >-
  A Python CLI that scaffolds Claude Code projects from detected project type. It
  emits a layered CLAUDE.md, a .claude/settings.json permission baseline, curated
  MIT-licensed skill bundles per profile (universal-software, frontend, backend,
  data-science, devops, academic), and hierarchical subdirectory CLAUDE.md examples. Positioned
  above obra/superpowers (declares a dependency, does not duplicate primitives).
  Detection-first, profile-based, idempotent.
